  textoConsejo: {fileID: 955617260}
  listaDeConsejos:
  - Remember to rest between punches; that's the only way to become a winner
  - With C, you'll throw punches harder than Mike Tyson
  - If you pull off a perfect block, the enemy will be stunned
  - Mati hardly ever brushes his teeth...
  - Cheese is good for your muscles!!
  - I got bored. I'm not giving you any advice
  - I don't get how some people think studying is better than fighting complete strangers.
  - The people in the back are very still... I'm starting to suspect they're mannequins
    with sound effects
  - You won't always be faster than your rival
  - Remember to rest between punches; that's the only way to become a winner
